    "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nWhen a user has `hide_profile` enabled, their bio, location, and website were still exposed through the user onebox preview. An authenticated user could request a onebox for a hidden user's profile URL and receive their hidden profile fields (bio, location, website) in the response.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
